    -- We use TO_CHAR(date, 'DY') or check the day of week number where 1=Monday (ISO standard).
    -- For standard Oracle behavior where 1=Sunday, we check if the day is not Saturday (7) or Sunday (1).
    -- However, to guarantee Monday=1, we use the standard SQL function MOD(DAYOFWEEK(date), 7) or similar logic,
